{"id":8,"title":"凉州词","dynasty":"唐","author":"王之涣","lines":[{"text":"黄河远上白云间，","pinyin":"huáng hé yuǎn shàng bái yún jiān","chars":[{"char":"黄","pinyin":"huáng"},{"char":"河","pinyin":"hé"},{"char":"远","pinyin":"yuǎn"},{"char":"上","pinyin":"shàng"},{"char":"白","pinyin":"bái"},{"char":"云","pinyin":"yún"},{"char":"间","pinyin":"jiān"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"一片孤城万仞山。","pinyin":"yí piàn gū chéng wàn rèn shān","chars":[{"char":"一","pinyin":"yí"},{"char":"片","pinyin":"piàn"},{"char":"孤","pinyin":"gū"},{"char":"城","pinyin":"chéng"},{"char":"万","pinyin":"wàn"},{"char":"仞","pinyin":"rèn"},{"char":"山","pinyin":"shān"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"羌笛何须怨杨柳，","pinyin":"qiāng dí hé xū yuàn yáng liǔ","chars":[{"char":"羌","pinyin":"qiāng"},{"char":"笛","pinyin":"dí"},{"char":"何","pinyin":"hé"},{"char":"须","pinyin":"xū"},{"char":"怨","pinyin":"yuàn"},{"char":"杨","pinyin":"yáng"},{"char":"柳","pinyin":"liǔ"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"春风不度玉门关。","pinyin":"chūn fēng bú dù yù mén guān","chars":[{"char":"春","pinyin":"chūn"},{"char":"风","pinyin":"fēng"},{"char":"不","pinyin":"bú"},{"char":"度","pinyin":"dù"},{"char":"玉","pinyin":"yù"},{"char":"门","pinyin":"mén"},{"char":"关","pinyin":"guān"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]}],"titlePinyin":["liáng","zhōu","cí"]}